-- WoW Forever: drops the trash of the new Forever dungeons has on live but not here. Checked for every trash NPC of the
-- 9 dungeons against Wowhead WoW Forever (drops over kills); every item that drops at least 4 times in 100 kills on live
-- and is missing from the NPC's loot here (counting its reference tables) is added at its live rate. Mostly cloth on the
-- humanoids (Silk, Mageweave), leather and hides on the beasts, Motes of Unstable Magic in Blackmaw Hold, the Twilight Bangle
-- and Chipped Ogre Teeth in Krol'dok Stronghold, and the beast parts at the Excavation Site. Rows already here are kept.
-- Safe to run again: rows carry the tag "wh1124b" in their comment and are replaced by it.
